{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_7_level_st_07-02","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"st_07-02","title":"26:37:14","storyCode":"7-7","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_07-02.txt","sourceHash":"6c0b7d2940047bb244cf60577a2337bdfc71d1f384c04c84357dacf0196a7357","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"时间不明"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"不拉窗帘吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"玻璃已经碎了。拉上窗帘只是欺骗自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"玻璃是小事，小陈她没事......才是大事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"身手很好。既不像她父亲，也不像她母亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，不像她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我脚下已经又是一片灯火通明。龙门城已恢复了往日气象，可之后会发生什么，他们尚一无所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这场灾难，陈晖洁一个人无法阻止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"还有罗德岛和她一起。他们会找到她的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"维特已经钳制不住保守派了。这么多年来他努力压制各个大公，却也只能削弱他们，没法彻底打败他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"大叛乱之后，各集团军将领和旧贵族已经元气大伤，他们的地位和资源只会被帝国议会逐一消化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"可我担心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"担心什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"如果维特在说谎呢？如果这件事正是维特和帝国皇帝谋划的呢？如果那个年轻的皇帝策划了这一切呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的敌人，一直身处暗处。我们却不得不站在最敞亮的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"比起其他许多人，你已经在暗处了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......还不够。就像当年一样。如果是科西切......如果是科西切，他会藏得更深。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"可你不是科西切。科西切不会把龙门建设成现在这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，小塔......如果小塔真是被科西切教成这样的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得，那个罗德岛的医生，她在说谎吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我不清楚。像这个医生一样的人，很少有不说谎的。罗德岛善于掩藏自己。他们对我们示弱，不会透露一点秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"但我宁可相信科西切塑造了现在的塔露拉。轻敌的恶果我们承担不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......小塔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"也正因如此，我不能让陈晖洁去做这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"科西切......事情正无疑向他期待的那样发展。即使他死了，他的愿景也可能被他的继承人塑造成型。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这一切绝不能如他所愿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"侦察队回报，一部分从龙门离开的感染者正往核心城的方向移动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"核心城必须停靠一段时间，这时间里他们会接收感染者难民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"纵使塔露拉露出了属于乌萨斯恶毒的尖牙，她也不会当着所有人的面背叛整合运动。这是最好的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我会带上影卫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"他们已经为我做得太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我答应过他们，不会再让他们手沾血腥，之后却一次次地打破承诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"现在又要让他们再为龙门而死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我也必与他们一同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你这样做，也是科西切想看的。你这样根本不算赢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......难道从我们夺回龙门开始，一切就滑向了科西切的陷阱吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我们胜利过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"最初是我们的胜利。即使惨痛，我、你、爱德华、舸瑞，没有我们，他将会把这座城市蚕食干净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来没有把这件事当成一个不幸的开始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也不会把爱德华的死算在科西切的头上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你想把它当一场噩梦吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"噩梦在科西切死的时候就该结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"他真的死了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"也许他活在塔露拉的身上。一个合格的继承者能让他混沌的生命得到延续。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉太像他了。没有子嗣的科西切得到了最适合的种子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......即使我可以把凯尔希的话当成谎言，我也无法否认事实。那就是针对龙门的阴谋，实在是太像科西切的手笔了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我不相信。小塔从来都不是那种人。她为什么要这么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你我现在不得不信。这一切都是塔露拉一手策划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"可如果她要觉得龙门会坐以待毙，她就大错特错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门不会失败。我不会让龙门受到丁点伤害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"却也不能阻止战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想让我与你共死吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"文月？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"——你在威胁我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"唉哟。不是。哎我不是这个意思。我是说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不！绝不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......懦夫才要搭上别人的性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"何况是你！我不可能....."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我曾懦弱过，但是，不，文月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我不允许任何人动你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我会把你藏起来。无论是莱塔尼亚还是萨尔贡，萨米......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能回东国，我把你送到遥远的国家去，送到那些没有人知道的宁静的小城去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我会把你藏在无人知晓的地方。胞弟......他再怎么恨我也不会追杀你到那么远的地方......他不会。对，他不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"可我也活不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你要我一个人独活吗，彦吾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你想用你的死来折磨我吗？你难道不记得你的妹妹是为什么在忧郁中死去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不......文月，不，我想你活着。我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彦吾，我是说......我可以的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"和你一起死，已经是我能想象到的糟糕结局里最好的一种。或者，它尽管很糟糕，对我来说，也是好结局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"文月，不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会做这种人。我也不许你这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"但你知道，你拦不住我的。我要做什么，你从来没拦住过我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"文月......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"彦吾，你一直对我说真心话的。你有时候会什么都不说，但你只要说了，我知道你只会对我说真心话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想你死。我也不想小塔死。我不想我们里任何一个人死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我想小塔了，她的面相和你的妹妹是那么像，但她的眼睛又像爱德华，小时候那脾气也不知道像谁......这么多年了，我这么多年没见她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"这一切是我们欠她的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有晖洁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"对。还有小陈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"小陈已经走了，我以后再也看不见她，再也没法给她买漂亮的衣服，给她梳些适合她的发型了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"她......她没那么喜欢传统的打扮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我喜欢啊。那有多漂亮，她会有多漂亮啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......可我还是想，哪怕这样，哪怕是就此永别，我也希望小陈在另一个地方好好活着，好好地活着。我就这么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你不想倚仗罗德岛，也清楚你不会把宝全部押在他们身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"但我想你等上一等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"让他们去做吧，彦吾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他们没做到，我们再一起去。你不想再沾上亲人的血了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"那我来帮你取走小塔的性命。然后我再和你共死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"文月......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你也更想她也活着吧？这座龙门城，难道是想我们所有人都去死吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我宁可再也见不到她们了。我宁可永远看不到小陈和小塔，把她们都忘了......我也想她们活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你一样。就像你也希望我这么选一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"文月。一旦事情陷入不可回转的境地，你必须听我的安排。我们的生命......不是不可分割的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不是。彦吾，我并不只是为了你才站在这里的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......我所做的一切，从头至尾，也不全是为了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你要看到我在坚持什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"别再躲躲闪闪了。看着我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我会坚持自己的决定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你想哭吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"要哭吗，彦吾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不。不，文月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"说真心话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"只是想在一座城市里休养生息的人，凭什么要遭遇无谓的死亡？\n我们不就只是想给他们一个家？我们不是想让所有和我们一样无处可去的人，有一个温暖的地方可以歇脚？\n我不就只是想建一座小城，一座能够让所有人安心住下的小城？\n现在这龙门城，又是为谁而建？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是个道德家。但文月，我细细看来，该死的还是只有一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"——我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要这样......别这样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我会让影卫送你去萨尔贡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"龙门是什么时候变成这样？\n我是究竟什么时候，变成了现在这样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彦吾"]},{"speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","aliases":["文月"]}]}
